docs {
  # Update Patient

  환자 정보를 수정합니다.

  ## Path Parameters

  | Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
  |-----------|------|----------|-------------|
  | patientId | number | **Yes** | 환자 ID |

  ## Request Body

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  |-------|------|----------|-------------|
  | dicomPatientId | string | No | DICOM Patient ID |
  | issuerOfPatientId | string | No | Patient ID 발급 기관 |
  | patientName | string | No | 환자 이름 |
  | patientBirthDate | string | No | 생년월일 (YYYY-MM-DD) |
  | patientSex | string | No | 성별 (M/F/O) |
  | emrPatientId | string | No | EMR 환자 ID |
  | matchingConfidence | number | No | 매칭 신뢰도 (0.0 ~ 1.0) |
  | matchingStatus | string | No | 매칭 상태 (AUTO_MATCHED, MANUAL_MATCHED, UNMATCHED) |

  ## Request Example

  ```json
  {
    "dicomPatientId": "PAT001-UPDATED",
    "issuerOfPatientId": "HOSPITAL_A",
    "patientName": "Hong Gildong Updated",
    "patientBirthDate": "1990-01-15",
    "patientSex": "M",
    "emrPatientId": "EMR001",
    "matchingConfidence": 0.95,
    "matchingStatus": "MANUAL_MATCHED"
  }
  ```

  ## Response

  ### Success (200)
  ```json
  {
    "code": 200000,
    "message": "OK",
    "data": {
      "id": 1,
      "uuid": "01936b6c-1234-7abc-def0-123456789abc",
      "dicomPatientId": "PAT001-UPDATED",
      "issuerOfPatientId": "HOSPITAL_A",
      "issuerTypeCode": "ISO",
      "patientName": "Hong Gildong Updated",
      "patientBirthDate": "1990-01-15",
      "patientSex": "M",
      "emrPatientId": "EMR001",
      "matchingConfidence": 0.95,
      "matchingStatus": "MANUAL_MATCHED",
      "studiesCount": 5,
      "lastStudyDate": "2026-01-08",
      "createdAt": "2026-01-08T10:30:00",
      "updatedAt": "2026-01-08T11:00:00",
      "tenantId": 1
    }
  }
  ```

  ### Error (404) - Not Found
  ```json
  {
    "code": 404000,
    "message": "Patient not found",
    "data": null
  }
  ```
}
